I'm looking at the edits for the dialog, which now includes an "Audit Details" section with fields like Last Modified User Id, Creation Date, Modified Date, and Is Valid. There's also an Invalidate button, likely only for valid entries, along with Cancel and Save options. The main fields are still there, but with fewer present. It seems the password fields may not be required, since they don't have an asterisk in the edit view, which is a bit different from what I expected.
