I’m considering the alert situation and whether the menu open/flyout is necessary. It seems some controls like the main menu are essential, so I might mention those. I’ll look at the menu-open and menu-flyout options, as well as the tab-flyout for context. Even if they aren't needed, it could still be good to explore them, so I’ll go ahead and open the menu-open to see what it’s like.
